The most important strategic point
I would not try to beat Royal Road, Wattpad, Inkitt, Radish and Kindle at everything.
I'd make NovelVerse's identity:
A cinematic social reading platform where readers discover addictive serialized stories, authors get powerful tools to build their audience, and African stories have a first-class home.

Then your strongest differentiators become:
1. Netflix-style discovery
2. Story DNA + "Find My Next Story"
3. Social/interactive reading
4. Live chapter premieres
5. Powerful author intelligence
6. NovelVerse Originals
7. African storytelling ecosystem
8. Reading + audiobook + offline in one experience